  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Ngao Foundation Purchase land for programs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will enable us to purchase land to implement new projects and also help in expanding our programs. Our current rented space is not enough to accommodate our growing programs, staff, volunteers, and beneficiaries. The need is just enormous. We face constant challenges such as high rent, and constant conflicts with the landlords, so it takes time before a decision is made. These challenges affect our ability to deliver quality programs and services to the people who need them most.</narrative>
  </description>
